
Contact Effect
Does nothing by itself, only does thing when present via tags.
Slippery tag on target -> Causes a 50% chance of the action to fail (because the item escaped)
Spiky tag on target -> Causes a 50% chance of a wound on the executor.
(Needs slippery tag to be added)

Consume Effect
If the target has edible, it gives the executor 1 wound back.
If the target does not have edible, the executor is hurt by 1 wound.
(Needs a new tag added) 

ForceMoveEffect <-
If the item is the same size as the executor, it's dependent on the roll (pass)
If the item is smaller than the executor, it's 100% allowed.
If the item is larger than the executor, it fails.
(Needs a size enum to be created and added to entity)
